  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Byok 35",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "35",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosiya naasemeza ekiro eky'Okwijuka Okuhingurwaho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro eky'Okwijuka Ekiro eky'Okuhingurwaho eky'okutamu MUKAMA ekitiinisa, omukama Yosiya, yakisemerezaaga Yerusaalemu; ha kiro ekya ikumi na bbina eby'okwezi okw'okubanza, baitaga omwana gw'entaama ogw'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakoma banyakatagara yabaha emirimo yabo, ei baraakoraga omunju ya MUKAMA, kandi yabateererra kugikoraga kurungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi akagambira Abaleevi abaayegeseze Isirairi yoona, abakaba bahoongiirwe MUKAMA ati: “Esanduuko ey'Endagaano erukwera mugite omunju, Solomooni mutabani wa Daudi omukama wa Isirairi ei yayombekere; tikikyayetaagwa kwikara nimugyetweka, kugiiha hanu kugitwara hali baitu muheerezeege MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu, n'abantu be Abaisirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.8.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 8:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mweteekanize, nimuhondera ebihanda byanyu, amaju aga Baisenkurwinywe nkooku gali, nimuhondera ebiragiro bya Daudi omukama wa Isirairi, n'ebya Solomooni omutabani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwemerre omu kiikaro ekirukwera, mwebaganiize omu bitebe eby'amaju ga baisenkuru bagenzi banyu abatali banyadiini, kandi buli muntu abe n'ekicweka eky'enju ya isenkuru, ey'Abaleevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwite omwana gw'entaama ogw'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, mweyeze, kandi muteekanirize bagenzi banyu, bahonderege ekigambo MUKAMA eki yagambiire Musa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, omukama Yosiya, abantu boona abakaba bali aho abatali banyadiini akabaha ebihongwa eby'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, ebyana by'entaama n'eby'emburabuzi ebirukuhika obukumi busatu, oteho enimi enkumi isatu, ebi akabiiha omu magana ge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyoro be, na bo baijwire omutima gw'engonzi baabiha abantu, banyakatagara, n'Abaleevi. Hilukiya, Zekaliya na Yehyeri, abanyoro abakuru ab'Enju ya MUKAMA, bakaha banyakatagara ebihongwa eby'Okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, ebyana by'entaama n'eby'emburabuzi enkumi ibiri n'orukaaga, n'enimi ebikumi bisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konaniya na uwe, Semaaya na Netaneeri abaanyina, Hasabiya, Yeyeri na Zobaadi bakuru b'Abaleevi, bakaha Abaleevi ebihongwa eby'Okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, ebyana by'entaama n'eby'emburabuzi, enkumi itaano, n'enimi ebikumi bitaano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu byona eby'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho obu byamazire kuteekanizibwa, banyakatagara baayemerra omu kiikaro kyabo, Abaleevi na bo baayemerra bali omu bihanda byabo, omukama nkooku yaragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaleevi baita omwana gw'entaama ogw'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, banyakatagara baamiisa esagama, Abaleevi ei baabahaire nibakyabaaga ebyonzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baata ha rubaju ebihongwa eby'okwokya, nukwo basobole kubigaba, nibagendera ha bitebe eby'amaju ga baisenkurubo ag'abantu abatali Banyadiini nkooku gakaba gali. Bahongere MUKAMA nkooku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabu kya Musa. Enimi nazo nukwo baazikozire bati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 12:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baayokya omwana gw'entaama ogw'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, ekiragiro nkooku kigamba; kandi ebihongwa ebirukwera, baabicumba omu binaga omu safuliya, n'omu bikarango, baabisembereza bwango abantu abandi boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma baayeteekaniriza bonka kandi baateekaniriza na banyakatagara, habwokuba banyakatagara batabani b'Arooni, bakasiiba nibatalibana nibahonga ebihongwa eby'okwokya n'enyama ey'ebisajwa, okuhika obwire kwira; Abaleevi nukwo kweteekaniriza, n'okuteekaniriza banyakatagara batabani b'Arooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.25.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Byok 25:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazini batabani b'Asafu, bakeemeerra omu kiikaro kyabo, omukama Daudi n'Asafu, Hemani, na Yedusuuni omuraguzi w'omukama, nkooku baaragiire; kandi ha buli irembo, hakaba haroho abalinzi; bakaba batarukwetaaga kuruga ha mulimo gwabo, habwokuba bagenzi baabo Abaleevi bakabateekaniriza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro eki, omulimo gwa MUKAMA gwona, okwijuka ekiro eky'okuhingurwaho n'okuhonga ebihongwa eby'okwokya ha itambiro lya MUKAMA, omukama Yosiya nkooku yaragiire nukwo gwateekaniziibwe guti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 12:1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, abantu ba Isirairi abakaba baroho nukwo baasemiize ekiro kikuru eky'Okwijuka Okuhingurwaho n'eky'emigaati etatumbisiibwe okumara ebiro musanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga omu businge bwa Samwiri omurangi omu Yuda, ekiro eky'Okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, kikaba kitakasemezibwamuga nk'eki; busaho n'omu ha bakama ba Isirairi na Isirairi, abasi ba Yerusaalemu, abakaba bali aho, akaba arasemiize ekiro eky'Okwijuka okuhingurwaho, nka Yosiya oku yakisemiize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogwa ikumi na munaana ogw'obusinge bwa Yosiya, ekiro eki eky'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, nubwo kyasemeziibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okufa kwa Yosiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi byona obu byahoire, Yosiya amazire kuteekaniza Enju ya MUKAMA, Neko omukama wa Misiri, akaramaga kurwana omu kiikaro Kakemesi, ekya ha kisaaru Efuraate, Yosiya yagenda kumurwanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neko yatumira Yosiya abakwenda naagamba ati, “Iwe omukama wa Yuda, nyowe na iwe, nituturangana ki? Kiro kinu, tinseesiire iwe, baitu nseesiire enju ei ndukurwanisa; kandi Ruhanga andagiire kurahuka. Olekere aho kurwanisa Ruhanga anyakuli hamu na nyowe, obu otaleke, naija kukuhwerekereza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Yosiya tiyamurugaho, yayehindura aleke kumanyirirwa, nukwo amurwanise. Ebigambo bya Neko ebyagambirwe Ruhanga tiyabihurra, baitu yataaha omu bulemu omu kihanga ekya Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarasi b'obuta, baamurasa, yagambira abaheereza be ati, “Munyihe hanu muntwale, habwokuba mputaire muno.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaheereza be, nukwo kumwiha omu kigaali, baamutwarra omu kigaali kye ekindi baamugarra Yerusaalemu yatuuza yatabaazibwa omu magasani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Magasani (egasani nikyo ekiikaro na mbere batabaazaga omukama)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ga baisenkuru. Yuda yoona na Yerusaalemu, zaamulirirra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya omurangi na uwe akacwererra ekizina eky'okuterra Yosiya empamo, okuhika na hati, abasaija n'abakazi boona abazini, obu baba nibamuterra empamo nibakyakizina. Omu Isirairi, eki bakakifoora kiragiro; kikahandiikwa omu mpamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebindi Yosiya ebi yakozire, ebintu bye ebirungi nkooku byahandiikirwe omu Biragiro bya MUKAMA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okuraga ha ky'okubanza okuhika ha ky'okumalirra, byona bikahandiikwa omu Kitabu eky'Abakama ba Isirairi na Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
